-- ============================================================
-- Research Summit — Loeb / Third Point LLC 13F backfill (2021 -> present)
-- Run this in the Supabase SQL Editor AFTER 014_investor_profiles.sql
-- (and independently of 015 / any Klarman backfill -- this file only
-- touches investor_key = 'loeb').
--
-- Generated by a one-off script (not checked into the repo) that
-- pulls every 13F-HR filing since 2021 for Daniel Loeb / Third Point
-- LLC (CIK 0001040273) from SEC EDGAR, parses the info-table XML the
-- same way the "Upload 13F" flow does, and matches tickers against
-- SEC's own company_tickers.json. Matching is intentionally
-- conservative: a near-exact match (allowing for common SEC-filer
-- abbreviations like HLDGS/HOLDINGS, FINL/FINANCIAL, and issuer names
-- truncated by the fixed-width XML field) is accepted only when it
-- resolves to exactly one ticker. A blank ticker means no confident
-- match was found, OR the name matched more than one ticker, e.g.
-- Alphabet's GOOG/GOOGL both file under the issuer name "ALPHABET
-- INC" -- company_name/cusip/weight_pct are always correct
-- regardless; a human can fill in the ticker later same as an
-- unresolved row in the manual upload flow.
--
-- Unit note: SEC 13F <value> is filed in whole dollars in some
-- quarters and in thousands of dollars in others (filing-agent
-- dependent, not a clean pre/post-2023 cutoff for Third Point's
-- filer). Each quarter here was independently sanity-checked against
-- Third Point's plausible total 13F equity value (spanning roughly
-- $2B-$18B across 2021-2026) and the value column normalized to true
-- whole dollars accordingly.
--
-- Each (investor_key, year, quarter) is deleted before its insert,
-- so this is safe to re-run.
-- ============================================================

